<mxCell id="diagram-scope" value="Logical correlations and still-pending inspection/token additions. Dashed links are not cross-store FKs. Handoff preparation/claim storage now has additive migrations; handlers remain absent.&lt;br/&gt;Knowledge 003 stores immutable manifests/outcomes; Workspace 004 reserves permanent idempotency claims and local outcomes. Inspection steps, command preconditions and physical-purge tombstones remain gaps." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;spacing=12;"><mxGeometry x="30" y="125" width="2070.3333333333335" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
